From: Bjarne <87858321+bjakra@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 22:47:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Setup: optional Now Playing step

After the gestures step, an optional step offers Now Playing (on-device
song recognition), off unless "Turn on" is pressed; it uses the same
switch as Graphite settings and is skipped when Now Playing isn't
installed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
